{
  "dom_id": "step-14004",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Evaluating Special Values of Logarithms",
  "problem": "Find the value of $\\log_{8}{8}.$",
  "worked_solution": "We have the general rule that\n\n$$\n\\log_n n = 1.\n$$\n\nIn our case, $n=8.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\log_{8}{8} =1.\n$$",
